          "role": "core-explanation",
          "description": "逐条讲解教材提出的三种力量，并用可观察的场景说明其逻辑。",
          "outcomeRefs": [
            "explain-three-forces"
          ],
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "shared-mechanism",
          "title": "共同机制与常见误解",
